clip spin
fps 12
loop no
weapon greatsword sword axe staff
tags attack aoe
0   rarm=25,0,10 rfore=75 larm=15,0,15 lfore=45 lleg=12 lknee=10 rleg=-8 rknee=12 spine=6 bob=-0.03
3   ease=out  coil  root=0,40,0 rarm=60,0,80 rfore=10 larm=30,0,50 spine=0,30,0 bob=-0.08
